WEBVTT

00:16:59.621 --> 00:17:03.079
and I wish I could figure out how to split
my time between my current project

00:17:03.079 --> 00:17:07.496
and the new one. I would describe this
moment in my business as strenuous

00:17:07.496 --> 00:17:11.788
and frightening, and I wish I could
make the day's last longer.

00:17:13.204 --> 00:17:19.413
I would describe this moment in my career
as perplexing and frustrating.

00:17:20.496 --> 00:17:25.788
I wish I could have advanced into a role
where I feel like I'd be making

00:17:25.788 --> 00:17:27.079
a real difference to people.

00:17:28.121 --> 00:17:31.871
I didn't even realize that's how I was
feeling about work until I read it.